== Effects ==
* Upon entering an {{R|Angel Room}}, spawns 5 normal blue wisp orbitals.
** Also applies to {{i|The Stairway}}'s shop.
* Donating to '''any''' kind of {{M|Beggar}} has a chance to create a random wisp orbital.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{I|Mom's Box|r+}}: The wisps have a 50% chance to be special wisps. Having both increases the chance to 100%.

